'   Load_Lib_Styles_Archimate()
'   Registered Theme Style Procedures
'       ↓
'   Load_Lib_Styles_AFTER()
'
'=========================================================
'
' BEFORE HOOKS
'
' Intended for:
'
'   - Override toolkit defaults
